    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FALL is a challenging and fun parkour game designed for those who trust their reflexes. Balance, speed, and focus \u2014 all are tested here!   </strong><br>Sometimes you'll fall from great heights, sometimes you'll make it at the last second, and sometimes... you'll need to keep your cool.  <br>But don\u2019t give up! Every failure brings you one step closer to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and entertaining levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Try \u2013 fall \u2013 learn \u2013 try again&quot; loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based parkour mechanics that demand full control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall, get up, try again!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, not only your reflexes but also your patience will be put to the test. Each level will push you further.  <br>Don\u2019t be afraid to fall \u2014 every fall is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious about what awaits you at the end?  <br>You\u2019ll have to play to find out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FALL is a challenging and fun parkour game designed for those who trust their reflexes. Balance, speed, and focus \u2014 all are tested here!   </strong><br>Sometimes you'll fall from great heights, sometimes you'll make it at the last second, and sometimes... you'll need to keep your cool.  <br>But don\u2019t give up! Every failure brings you one step closer to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and entertaining levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Try \u2013 fall \u2013 learn \u2013 try again&quot; loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based parkour mechanics that demand full control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall, get up, try again!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, not only your reflexes but also your patience will be put to the test. Each level will push you further.  <br>Don\u2019t be afraid to fall \u2014 every fall is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious about what awaits you at the end?  <br>You\u2019ll have to play to find out.</p>",
